{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1LzIwMTIlMjAlMjgyMDA5JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"2012","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/c2PkTPT5D9zB8SIm5wNlDAANEqM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4P71rDf6roxVskbvdcbNayVMpXd.jpg","description":"Dr. Adrian Helmsley, part of a worldwide geophysical team investigating the effect on the earth of radiation from unprecedented solar storms, learns that the earth's core is heating up. He warns U.S. President Thomas Wilson that the crust of the earth is becoming unstable and that without proper preparations for saving a fraction of the world's population, the entire race is doomed. Meanwhile, writer Jackson Curtis stumbles on the same information. While the world's leaders race to build \"arks\" to escape the impending cataclysm, Curtis struggles to find a way to save his family. Meanwhile, volcanic eruptions and earthquakes of unprecedented strength wreak havoc around the world.","releaseInfo":"2009","genres":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.9","runtime":"158 min","cast":["John Cusack","Amanda Peet","Chiwetel Ejiofor","Thandiwe Newton","Oliver Platt","Tom McCarthy","Woody Harrelson","Danny Glover"],"director":["Roland Emmerich"],"released":"2009-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"We were warned.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"John Cusack","character":"Jackson Curtis","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aCwCx6JU7Jxbg6Q1ygcnLY750le.jpg"},{"name":"Amanda Peet","character":"Kate Curtis","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5TfyCj0X9ftKO11FN057P05s78C.jpg"},{"name":"Chiwetel Ejiofor","character":"Adrian Helmsley","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kq5DDnqqofoRI0t6ddtRlsJnNPT.jpg"},{"name":"Thandiwe Newton","character":"Laura Wilson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hZQLvxj7nV7pBrRyWTvWVz1CDi8.jpg"},{"name":"Oliver Platt","character":"Carl Anheuser","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ipBzOzgWRdx